@startuml
' Process View - Refactoring Sequence

!theme plain
actor User
participant "cli.main" as CLI
participant "integrations.client" as Client

User -> CLI: 1. poetry run python src/cli/main.py apply ...
activate CLI

CLI -> Client: 2. repair(input_path, output_path)
activate Client
Client -> Client: 3. Spawns 'parfum repair -o ...' subprocess
Client --> CLI: 4. Returns success status
deactivate Client

CLI -> User: 5. Prints success message
deactivate CLI

@enduml
